sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(227,242,253) Public Zone
    participant B as Cockpit in the browser
  end
  box rgb(232,245,233) Internal Trusted Zone
    participant I as Bank IdP
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Hosts
    participant L as Loans host
    participant K as KYC host
  end
  B->>B: load cockpit-hosts.json, validate against the v1 schema
  alt invalid config
    B->>B: config error screen naming the JSON Pointer, no host is called
  end
  B->>I: authorize, code challenge S256, state, nonce
  I-->>B: redirect with code
  B->>I: token request with code verifier
  I-->>B: ID token, refresh token kept in memory only
  par one token per host scope
    B->>I: refresh grant, scope loans-bpm
    I-->>B: access token, aud loans-bpm, 5 min
  and
    B->>I: refresh grant, scope kyc-bpm
    I-->>B: access token, aud kyc-bpm, 5 min
  end
  par probe every host
    B->>L: GET /api/bpm/meta and /api/bpm/me
    L-->>B: engine 0.3.1, features, permissions
  and
    B->>K: GET /api/bpm/meta and /api/bpm/me
    alt token audience is another host
      K-->>B: 401, host logs the audience mismatch
    else engine older than the previous minor
      K-->>B: engine 0.1.4
      B->>B: KYC marked UNSUPPORTED_VERSION, its screens turned off
    end
  end
  Note over B,K: No database transaction is involved in sign-in, hosts only read
